WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.300
Everything said here can be turned into tasks.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.500
Your team talks it through. It is all saved as a discussion file.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.100
Pick the discussion. Find the tasks.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.300
Nothing is added until you choose.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.400
Thirteen tasks. One board.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.850
Draft. Review. Commit.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.300
Classes, groups and spaces. Where the work lives.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.000
And it looks like yours.

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.950
Collabify. Work together. Build better.
